      "content": "1. 839 SP 9907 NE 2/126 HIGH STREET (North Side) Nos 82 to 86 (even) II 2. C17 or earlier, much altered.  2 storeys, whitewashed brick, old tiled roofs. Central segmentally arched carriageway, 2 C19 shop fronts projecting on left, modern shop on right, projecting 1st floor above with 2 gables. 5 1st floor flush casements with glazing bars. Listing NGR: SP9951307671"
